      "summaries": {
        "en": "This DistilBERT-based model detects malicious URLs by classifying them as phishing or legitimate, addressing the growing threat of online scams. It uses transfer learning from a pre-trained language model to analyze URL text patterns and semantic features for accurate identification. Developers can integrate it via Hugging Face's pipeline API for real-time web filtering or fine-tune it with custom datasets to adapt to evolving phishing tactics.",
        "zh": "该模型基于DistilBERT架构，专门用于检测恶意URL，通过文本分类区分钓鱼链接与合法网址，帮助应对日益增多的网络欺诈威胁。其技术核心在于利用预训练语言模型的迁移学习能力，从URL的文本模式和语义特征中识别恶意意图，实现高效准确的检测。用户可通过Hugging Face的API快速集成到网络安全应用中，进行实时网址过滤，也可使用自定义数据集微调模型，以适应不断变化的钓鱼攻击手法，为个人或企业提供灵活的网络防护方案。",
        "es": "This DistilBERT-based model detects malicious URLs by classifying them as phishing or legitimate, addressing the growing threat of online scams. It uses transfer learning from a pre-trained language model to analyze URL text patterns and semantic features for accurate identification. Developers can integrate it via Hugging Face's pipeline API for real-time web filtering or fine-tune it with custom datasets to adapt to evolving phishing tactics.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "malicious-url-detection stands out for transformers, safetensors, and distilbert in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "This DistilBERT-based model detects malicious URLs by classifying them as phishing or legitimate, addressing the growing threat of online scams. It uses transfer learning from a pre-trained language model to analyze URL text patterns and semantic features for accurate identification. Developers can integrate it via Hugging Face's pipeline API for real-time web filtering or fine-tune it with custom datasets to adapt to evolving phishing tactics.",
          "how": "Review https://huggingface.co/kmack/malicious-url-detection for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
